 /* ============================== LOUNGE LIVE TV ==============================
- * Four independent TVs on the bar wall, one tuner each.
- * Lineup (iptv-org database, main US feeds): CBS News 24/7 - ABC News Live -
- * CNBC - LiveNOW from FOX. TV n starts on channel n.
- * - REMOTES: four remotes sit on the bar, one per TV. Walk up to grab one;
- *   while holding it, T changes THAT TV's channel.
