- *   hls.js when the stream carries them.
- * - SOUND: walk up to a TV and press V — that TV unmutes (others mute).
- *   Walk away and it mutes itself.
- * Dead/geo-blocked/CORS-poisoned streams auto-skip. Failure never breaks
- * the game — screens fall back to their idle art. */
